# Reviewed seed priorities for automatic free-model selection (2026-10-16).
# dispatch reads fresh audit evidence, removes ineligible seeds and admits discovered free
# candidates automatically. Up to 9 models per task; one rotating newcomer gets position 2.
# The task receipt records the effective order/reasons. Errors/stalls advance the runner.
#
# Rules for this file
# - Free only (kcn 2026-10-11), updated by kcn 2026-10-16: "zen无所谓吧".
#   Require OpenCode catalog input/output zero and Zen membership; models.dev is a cross-check.
#   Any explicit nonzero catalog/models.dev price rejects the model. Missing models.dev
#   metadata is recorded as unknown, allowed with catalog zero; Zen cost is not required.
#   check-free-pool.py rejects retired/invalid/duplicate names. The sole non-suffixed name
#   exception is opencode/big-pickle, explicitly requested by kcn on 2026-10-16.
# - This host copy is immutable (chattr +i). To change it: chattr -i, back up, write a temp file,
#   run check-free-pool.py on it, rename it over this one, verify catalog and cost, chattr +i.
#   The repository copy (ops/host/agent-dispatch/) carries the same bytes, so the installer and
#   refresh_live.sh see nothing to restore; change both in the same PR.
# - kcn 2026-10-16: "可以进池子吧我觉得 无所谓的", "让codex自己决定", and automatic
#   free selection requested. This supersedes the 10-11 no-last-resort/admission-by-record
#   restriction. Tool success and patrol yield are evidence, no longer admission prerequisites.
#   Keep scoring finished rounds and noise; do not change models on output quality mid-task.
#   Safety checks can exclude a model before an attempt if its price/membership changes.
#
